      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="now slide-in-block">
    <h2>Now</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>MSCS @ Georgia Tech (2024-2026): ML + systems</li>
      <li>Building reproducible eval + interpretability tooling</li>
      <li>
        Availability: Oct 2025 - Apr 2026 for ML Alignment Fellowship
        (extendable)
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section> -->

  <section class="about-this-site slide-in-block">
    <h2>About This Digital Garden</h2>
    <p>
      This site is my <strong>digital garden</strong>-a place where ideas can
      grow and evolve over time. Unlike a traditional blog, content here isn't
      organized chronologically but by connections and themes. Some pieces are
      polished articles, others are rough notes or works in progress.
    </p>
    <p>
      I believe in <strong>learning in public</strong>, sharing not just the
      final results but the messy process of figuring things out. If you see
      something interesting, wrong, or want to discuss an idea,
      <a href="mailto:hello@tylercrosse.com">drop me a line</a>!
    </p>

    <p>
      Built with <a
        href="https://astro.build/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro</a
      >. Check out the <a
        href="https://github.com/tylercrosse/personal-site"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">source code</a
      >. It would be a little weird to just copy it wholesale.
    </p>

    <section class="inspiration-details">
      <h3>Sites that inspired this one</h3>
      <ul class="inspiration-list">
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://distill.pub/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <strong>Distill.pub</strong>
          </a> - Interactive machine learning research papers
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://maggieappleton.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <strong>Maggie Appleton</strong>
          </a> - The digital garden philosophy and visual thinking
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.arlenmccluskey.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <strong>Arlen McCluskey</strong>
          </a> - Clear technical writing and site structure
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://eugeneyan.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <strong>Eugene Yan</strong>
          </a> - Thoughtful ML content and career insights
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.swyx.io/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <strong>Swyx</strong>
          </a> - Learning in public and developer advocacy
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://lowyx.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <strong>Yxlow</strong>
          </a> - Minimalist design and thoughtful curation
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </section>

  <style>
    section {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }

    .headshot {
      margin: 2rem auto;
      max-width: 300px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .headshot img {
      border: 8px solid #fff;
    }

    .intro {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .intro h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--sol-base01);
    }

    .intro .eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--sol-base1);
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .intro h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.1rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--sol-base01);
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--sol-base0);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .quick-links {
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.25rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--black), 0.12);
      padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--sol-base00);
      transition:
        border-color 0.2s ease,
        color 0.2s ease,
        background-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .pill:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
      background: rgba(var(--accent-rgb, 35, 131, 226), 0.08);
    }

    .now,
    .philosophy {
      background: rgba(var(--black), 0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--black), 0.08);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .now h2,
    .philosophy h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      color: var(--sol-base01);
    }

    .now-list,
    .philosophy-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 1.25rem 0 0 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--sol-base0);
    }

    .philosophy p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--sol-base0);
    }

    .philosophy-list strong {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .journey {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .journey p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .timeline {
      position: relative;
      /* margin: 2rem 0; */
    }
    .timeline-item {
      position: relative;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      /* padding-left: 60px; */
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .timeline-marker {
      position: absolute;
      left: 11px;
      top: 8px;
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--sol-base2);
      border: 3px solid var(--sol-base3);
    }

    .timeline-content h3 {
      color: var(--sol-base01);
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }

    .company {
      color: var(--sol-blue);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
    }

    .description {
      color: var(--sol-base0);
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .interests-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }

    .interest-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
      color: var(--sol-base01);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .interest-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--sol-base0);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* .about-this-site {
        background: var(--sol-base3);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 2rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--sol-base2);
      } */

    .about-this-site p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .inspiration-list li {
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      padding-left: 1rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .inspiration-list a {
      color: var(--sol-blue);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .inspiration-list a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .slide-in-block {
      opacity: 0;
      filter: blur(10px);
      transform: scale(0.95);
      will-change: transform, opacity, filter;
      animation: slideInBlock 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.43, 0.195, 0.02, 1) forwards;
    }

    .slide-in-block:nth-child(1) {
      animation-delay: 0s;
    }
    .slide-in-block:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: 0.1s;
    }
    .slide-in-block:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }
    .slide-in-block:nth-child(4) {
      animation-delay: 0.3s;
    }
    .slide-in-block:nth-child(5) {
      animation-delay: 0.4s;
    }
    .slide-in-block:nth-child(6) {
      animation-delay: 0.5s;
    }

    @keyframes slideInBlock {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        filter: blur(0px);
        transform: scale(1);
      }
    }

    /* Dark theme adjustments */
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      .headshot img {
        /* border-color: var(--sol-base02); */
      }

      .now,
      .philosophy {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      }

      .interest-card {
        background: var(--sol-base02);
        border-color: var(--sol-base01);
      }

      .about-this-site {
        background: var(--sol-base02);
        border-color: var(--sol-base01);
      }

      .timeline::before {
        background: var(--sol-base01);
      }

      .timeline-marker {
        background: var(--sol-base01);
        border-color: var(--sol-base02);
      }
    }

    /* Mobile responsive */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .intro h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }

      .lead {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }

      .now,
      .philosophy {
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      .interests-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .timeline-item {
        padding-left: 50px;
      }

      .timeline::before {
        left: 15px;
      }

      .timeline-marker {
        left: 6px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
